{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_53_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_53","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_53_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_53","textTraditional":"二十有四年春王三月，刻桓宮桷。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_53_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_53","textTraditional":"葬曹莊公。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_53_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_53","textTraditional":"夏，公如齊逆女。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_53_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_53","textTraditional":"秋，公至自齊。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_53_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_53","textTraditional":"八月丁丑，夫人姜氏入。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_53_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_53","textTraditional":"戊寅，大夫宗婦覿，用幣。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_53_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_53","textTraditional":"大水。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_53_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_53","textTraditional":"冬，戎侵曹。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_53_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_53","textTraditional":"曹羈出奔陳。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_53_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_53","textTraditional":"赤歸于曹。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_53_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_53","textTraditional":"郭公。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_53_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_53","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_53_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_53","textTraditional":"二十四年春，刻其桷，皆非禮也。御孫諫曰：「臣聞之：『儉，德之共也；侈，惡之大也。』先君有共德，而君納諸大惡，無乃不可乎！」","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_ttr_53_15","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_53","textTraditional":"秋，哀姜至。公使宗婦覿，用幣，非禮也。御孫曰：「男贄，大者玉帛，小者禽鳥，以章物也。女贄，不過榛栗棗脩，以告虔也。今男女同贄，是無別也。男女之別，國之大節也。而由夫人亂之，無乃不可乎！」","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_ttr_53_16","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_53","textTraditional":"晉士蒍又與羣公子謀，使殺游氏之二子。士蒍告晉侯曰：「可矣。不過二年，君必無患。」","sentenceOrder":16}],"overrides":{}}